"""Reviewed CareerNova website help. Answers and links come only from this catalog."""
def article(key,title,questions,answer,path,related):
    return {'id':key,'title':title,'questions':questions,'answer':answer,'path':path,'related':related}

ARTICLES=[
 article('start','Getting started','how does careernova work what is this website getting started features onboarding',
 'CareerNova helps you discover jobs, compare your resume with roles, and organize applications. Create an account, complete your Candidate Profile, then open Find jobs or Resume match. Career tools contains the resume library, interview practice, reminders, saved searches, job comparison and privacy controls.', '/register',['profile','search','matching']),
 article('register','Create an account','register registration sign up create account join new user access protected features',
 'Choose Sign Up, enter your full name and email, and use a password of at least 12 characters. After registration, you can access the protected workspace. Email/password registration works even when Google or GitHub sign-in is not set up.', '/register',['login','profile','social']),
 article('login','Sign in to your workspace','login log in sign in existing account session expired logged out access denied',
 'Open Login and enter the email and password used when registering. Sessions last eight hours. If your session expires, sign in again to access protected pages. You can review and revoke sessions in Privacy & security.', '/login',['password','sessions','social']),
 article('password','Forgot or change your password','forgot password reset password change password recovery link expired password cannot remember',
 'On Login, choose Forgot your password and enter your account email. When email delivery is configured, CareerNova sends a single-use reset link that expires after 30 minutes. Choose a new password of at least 12 characters. Resetting the password signs out existing sessions. If no email arrives, check spam and ask the site owner to check delivery configuration.', '/forgot-password',['login','social','email']),
 article('social','Google and GitHub sign-in','google github oauth social login sign in buttons not working not set up unavailable buffering spinner hover loading',
 'Google and GitHub sign-in work only after the site owner configures each provider. A button marked Not set up is unavailable, not buffering. Use email/password login meanwhile. To link a provider to an existing account, sign in first, open Privacy & security, and choose Link Google or Link GitHub when available. CareerNova does not automatically merge accounts by email.', '/login',['login','password','sessions']),
 article('search','Search and filter jobs','find jobs search jobs browse openings vacancies remote hybrid onsite location employment type career field live historical dataset',
 'Open Find jobs and choose Historical dataset or Live Jobs. Enter a job title, skill or company, then use employment type, work arrangement, career field and location filters. Historical records may no longer be open, so check the employer posting before applying. Live feeds depend on the sources configured by the site owner.', '/jobs',['saved-searches','duplicates','matching']),
 article('historical','Historical versus live listings','historical dataset jobs old expired listings live feeds sources remotive greenhouse lever availability',
 'Historical dataset results are stored records and are not verified as currently open. Live Jobs reads configured feeds; refresh it to check available feed results. Always review the employer posting for current requirements and availability. A live-feed label or employer review is not a guarantee that the role is still open.', '/jobs',['search','reports','duplicates']),
 article('saved-searches','Save your search filters','save search saved searches restore filters remember filter combinations rename search rerun previous search',
 'On Find jobs, set your keywords and filters, enter a Search name, and choose Save current filters. You can store up to 30 searches. Use the saved-search selector to Load search or Update with current filters. Career tools > Saved searches lets you run, rename and remove saved combinations.', '/searches',['search','alerts','duplicates']),
 article('duplicates','Duplicate and already-tracked jobs','duplicate duplicated repeated same job combine copies already applied tracked job different source requisition',
 'CareerNova combines clear copies from live feeds when their canonical posting URL, title and company match. Different requisition IDs remain separate; similar-looking openings are only flagged as possible duplicates. Job cards show your own tracking stage, and saving a clear duplicate returns the existing tracked entry without overwriting its notes or stage.', '/jobs',['saved-jobs','board','historical']),
 article('saved-jobs','Save a job','save job bookmark saved jobs favorites favourite watchlist keep opportunity',
 'Choose Save Job on a job card or resume-match result. Saved opportunities appear in Saved jobs and the Application board. Already-tracked postings show their current stage and a View application activity link. Saving a job does not submit an application to the employer.', '/saved',['board','timeline','compare']),
 article('board','Application board and stages','application board kanban pipeline track applications status applied interview offer rejected drag card change stage notes',
 'Open Applications to see Saved, Applied, Interview, Offer and Rejected columns. Drag a card between columns or use its status menu. Application details lets you choose a stored resume and add compensation or requirements. Dashboard also supports status updates and notes. Stage, note and detail changes appear in Timeline.', '/applications',['timeline','resumes','reminders']),
 article('timeline','Application timeline','timeline activity history recruiter reply submission interview event record when happened backdated notes stage changes',
 'Open Timeline or choose View activity on a tracked job. Saves, stage transitions, note edits and detail changes are recorded automatically. Use Record an event to add recruiter replies, interviews, submissions, offers or notes with the date they happened. Filter by application to focus the history. Earlier activity is not reconstructed; automatic entries cannot be removed individually.', '/timeline',['board','reminders','saved-jobs']),
 article('matching','AI resume matching','resume match matching score percentage faiss similarity skills fit relevant roles upload cv match explanation accuracy',
 'Open Resume match to upload a text-based PDF or DOCX of at most 5 MB, or choose Find matches from a stored resume in the library. The existing embedding/FAISS search returns relevant historical dataset records. When recognized job skills exist, the score combines 70% semantic similarity and 30% skill coverage, clamped to 0–100. Scores help rank roles and do not predict hiring outcomes.', '/resume',['resumes','coaching','historical']),
 article('resumes','Resume versions and uploads','resume library multiple resumes versions store resume download delete pdf docx file upload size resume for application',
 'Open Resume library under Career tools. Give a version a name and upload a readable PDF or DOCX of at most 5 MB; you can keep up to ten versions. Download or delete versions there, choose Find matches to search with one, and select a version in Application details. Nova can use a selected stored version when an employer form asks for a file.', '/resumes',['matching','coaching','assistant']),
 article('coaching','Resume coaching and improvements','improve resume coaching missing skills bullet points suggestions rewrite experience accomplishments cv tips',
 'In Resume library, choose a saved version, paste the target job description, and select Get suggestions. Coaching shows recognized missing skills, resume structure checks and bullet templates. Replace placeholders only with facts you can support; never invent experience or results. Explain match shows the actual semantic similarity, skill coverage and scoring limits.', '/resumes',['matching','resumes','interview']),
 article('profile','Candidate Profile','candidate profile personal details skills education work experience phone linkedin autofill profile incomplete save profile',
 'Open My Profile or Profile, fill in your contact details, skills, education, experience and application preferences, then save. Your profile is private to your account and supplies known details to Nova. Review it before applying, especially names, email addresses and phone numbers.', '/profile',['assistant','matching','privacy']),
 article('assistant','Apply with Nova','nova apply application assistant playwright employer form autofill voice hands free login employer browser submit application',
 'On a job card, choose Apply with Nova, review the selected job, then Start application assistant. Nova opens a local employer browser and helps with supported fields using your saved profile or answers you confirm. Complete employer login or verification yourself, then continue the assistant. Review all answers in the employer browser and submit manually. Nova is a local feature, not a hosted autonomous application service.', '/jobs',['profile','resumes','board']),
 article('alerts','Create and manage job alerts','job alerts notify new openings rule keywords pause resume alert inbox check new matches notification',
 'Open Job alerts, enter role keywords and an optional location, and create an alert. You can keep up to 20 rules and pause, resume or remove them. Check new matches refreshes the in-app inbox. Automatic checks require the alert worker to be running. For email digests, opt in and verify your address in the delivery preferences.', '/alerts',['email','saved-searches','reminders']),
 article('email','Email digests and delivery','email alerts daily digest no email inbox spam verification verify address smtp worker delivery notifications not arriving',
 'In Alerts or Privacy, enable email digests and request verification if your address is not verified. Digests and reminder emails require your opt-in, verified address, configured SMTP delivery and the running alert worker. Check spam if a link does not arrive. Site owners can inspect worker and mail status in Administration; unavailable delivery does not prevent manual in-app checks.', '/alerts',['alerts','password','reminders']),
 article('interview','Interview practice','interview preparation practice questions answer behavioral star role technical preparation studio',
 'Open Interview studio in Career tools. Enter the role title and job description to create guided questions based on the role and recognized skills. Write answers using your real experience, save them, and reopen the practice session later. This studio uses guided templates and does not judge your hiring eligibility.', '/interview',['coaching','profile','reminders']),
 article('reminders','Deadlines and follow-up reminders','reminder deadline interview time follow up followup calendar due date overdue mark done',
 'Open Your reminders from Career tools. Add a title, choose Deadline, Interview or Follow-up, pick a local date and time, and optionally link an application. Mark it done when complete. Dates display in your device timezone. Reminder emails depend on verified email, delivery opt-in and the running worker; direct calendar integration is not implemented.', '/reminders',['email','timeline','board']),
 article('compare','Compare job opportunities','compare jobs comparison salary compensation location requirements benefits side by side offers',
 'Save the roles first, then open Compare opportunities in Career tools and select up to four jobs. Compare company, location, compensation, match score, application stage and requirements side by side. Add salary and requirements through Application details; unknown information stays marked Not provided.', '/compare',['saved-jobs','board','matching']),
 article('reports','Report a job or check an employer','report listing suspicious scam misleading expired job verified employer trust review domain unsafe company',
 'Use Report listing on a job card, choose a reason, and describe the problem. Employer reviews & reports shows your report status and reviewed employer domains. Administrators must review evidence before marking a domain Verified. A review does not guarantee that every listing is safe or current.', '/trust',['historical','duplicates','admin']),
 article('privacy','Export data and delete an account','privacy personal data export download information delete account permanently remove account data resumes',
 'Open Privacy & security in Career tools or Settings. Download my data exports your profile, applications, saved searches, timeline and other personal records as JSON; download original resume files from the library. Permanent account deletion requires confirmation plus your password or recent linked-provider sign-in. It removes your personal workspace, while submitted moderation reports keep their text with the account reference removed.', '/privacy',['sessions','resumes','settings']),
 article('sessions','Manage sign-ins and active sessions','session security active sessions sign out other device logout revoke connected google github link accounts',
 'Privacy & security lists your current and other active sessions. Sign out a session to revoke it immediately. Sessions normally expire after eight hours, and resetting your password revokes existing sessions. You can link configured Google or GitHub providers there while signed in, or reauthenticate with an already linked provider.', '/privacy',['password','social','privacy']),
 article('settings','Account settings','settings change name update account preferences theme dark light mode notification preference',
 'Open Settings to edit your account name and reach candidate profile, password recovery, privacy and notification controls. The header Light/Dark button changes the website theme. The account email is read-only in this build; there is no email-change workflow yet.', '/settings',['profile','privacy','email']),
 article('admin','Administrator access','admin administrator administration access forbidden permissions allowlist feed health worker email retry moderate',
 'Administration is restricted to accounts whose exact email is on the site owner’s ADMIN_EMAILS allowlist and whose email is verified. The backend checks this on every admin request. Administrators can review reports/domains, inspect feed and worker health and retry failed email. An Admin link alone does not grant access.', '/admin',['reports','email','privacy']),
 article('help','What Nova Help can do','chatbot nova chat website help ask questions explain features where do i go support what can you do',
 'I answer questions about CareerNova’s features and explain where to find them. Ask about job search, resume matching, applications, alerts, saved searches, privacy or account access. I use reviewed website help and can suggest relevant pages. I cannot inspect your private applications, change settings, send messages or submit job applications from this chat.', '/tools',['search','matching','board']),
]
BY_ID={entry['id']:entry for entry in ARTICLES}
